  "description": "MindCraft is an open-source academic platform for designing, deploying and collecting data from online behavioural experiments (reaction time, decision-making, questionnaires, physiological tasks). It provides a no-code study builder, participant management, RGPD-compliant data export and an open-science workflow for psychology and cognitive science research.",
